rem Integer Equiangular Hexagons
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=600

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option N integer = 55106

rem Sides (a, b, c, a - t, b + t, c - t)
rem close an equiangular hexagon.
rem Burnside over the 12 symmetries:
rem (I + 2 R1 + 2 R2 + R3 + 3 Fe
rem + 3 Fo) / 12, with I the sides in
rem order, R the rotations (all equal,
rem x y x y x y, x y z x y z) and F the
rem reflections (a b c d c b with
rem a + b = c + d, and a a c a a c).
Dl = (0 - N) to N array
Lp = 2 * Dl + 3
Lb = (Dl at least 0) choose Lp (3 - Dl)
Rd = (N + Dl) // 2 - Lb
Rm = Rd max (0 - 1)
Cn = (Rm + 3) * (Rm + 2) * (Rm + 1) // 6
Id = Cn sum
R1 = N // 6
M3 = N // 3
R2 = M3 * (M3 - 1) // 2
M2 = N // 2
R3 = M2 * (M2 - 1) * (M2 - 2) // 6
Bs = 1 to M3 array
A1 = ((N - 4 * Bs + 1) // 3) max 0
A2 = ((N - 3 * Bs - 1) // 2) max A1
T1 = A1 * (A1 + 1) // 2 + A1 * (Bs - 1)
T2 = (A2 - A1) * (N - 3 * Bs)
S2 = A2 * (A2 + 1) - A1 * (A1 + 1)
T2 = T2 - S2
Fe = (T1 + T2) sum
As = 1 to ((M2 - 1) // 2) array
Fo = (M2 - 2 * As) sum
Rt = 2 * R1 + 2 * R2 + R3
Ft = 3 * Fe + 3 * Fo
Answer = (Id + Rt + Ft) // 12
Answer print
